        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waenderera kugomba na Musa achimuamba, “Hala isabu ya atu a mryango wa Merari kulengana na miryango yao na nyumba zao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
